cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "Please cite the exact AgentOS-RK software version when using this research kit. Cite the associated ASE publication when referring to the underlying AgentOS architecture."
type: software
title: "AgentOS-RK: A Compact and Auditable Research Kit for LLM-Agent Execution"
abstract: "A research kit for reproducible evaluation of tool-using LLM agents, combining pinned AgentOS source reconstruction, deterministic replay, task-specific world-effect judging, and auditable research results."
